# 换行策略：写进仓库，保证任何机器克隆出来行为一致
#
# 本机 Git for Windows 默认 core.autocrlf=true，会在检出时把 LF 换成 CRLF，
# 于是 git add 时会不停提示 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"。这里显式声明策略，
# 提示就不再出现，仓库里始终存 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理和 PowerShell 脚本用 CRLF（cmd 对 LF 结尾的批处理容错较差）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止任何换行/编码处理
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
